title: Confronting the Nazis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (nsdap_r >= 10 and nazi_urgency > 1) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0 and antifa_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/iron_front.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

# Forming the Iron Front

The Nazis' strength is gaining, as shown by their recent election results and their violent presence in the streets. Their fascism threatens to plunge Germany once again into the abyss.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. While some of the more orthodox leadership beleive the social fascists to be a bigger threat, no one can deny the unanticipated rise of the NSDAP and many call for action.

- @not_a_big_deal: The Nazis' moment will pass. Let's not get too hasty.
- @economic_crisis
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the Nazis.
- @antifa_form


@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; conciliator_dissent += 10; right_opposition_dissent += 10
view-if: leber_advisor = 0 and schumacher_advisor = 0

The Nazis are just another far-right movement that will die of its own contradictions sooner or later; we do not need to build a specific policy to combat them.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@major_crisis
view-if: nazi_urgency < 5
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1; conciliator_dissent -= 5; conciliator_strength += 5

The Nazis are one of the foremost threats to the German republic. However, we are still formulating a strategy to confront them, and still trying to build up consensus within our party for action. Check back on this later.

@antifa_form
title: Form Antifaschistische Aktion!
subtitle: Antifaschistische Aktion.
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 4 and antifa_formed == 0
on-arrival: antifa_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; nazi_urgency += 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_strength += 5
achievement: eiserne_front

The Nazi threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront them - Antifaschistische Aktion - a communist front of workers, the Roter Massenselbstschutz, and the RFB. Its symbol is two red flags, represeting unity between socialists and communists against the Nazi threat.

What do the three arrows stand for?

- @antifa_flavor: A united front against fascism...



@antifa_flavor
go-to: if_end

@if_end

Antifaschistische Aktion has given a new energy to our party.